=== Episode 1: Cakes ===
For the first signature challenge, the bakers were given 2 hours to make a [[Madeira cake|Madeira Cake]], which was chosen as an "easy" challenge for the bakers. The cake should have a dome and a crack on top, though Mary stated the cake should not differ too far from the original. For the technical challenge, the bakers had 1 hour and 45 minutes to make Mary Berry's recipe for a Walnut Cake, which should have three layers, a meringue coating, and [[Caramelization|caramelised]] [[walnut]]s. For the showstopper, challenge the bakers had {{frac|3|1|2}} hours to make a [[Black Forest gâteau|Black Forest Gâteau]]. The bakers were tasked with making a cake that should be extravagant and should "impress" Mary and Paul.{{table alignment}}
