=== Episode 3: Bread ===
In their signature challenge, the bakers were given {{frac|1|1|2}} hour to make 2 [[quick bread|quick breads]] to be made free-form (i.e. not in a tin). For the technical challenge, Paul set the bakers the challenge of baking 4 identical crusty [[baguette]]s in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers needed to make a 3D bread sculpture in 5 hours, using three types of dough, and one of them should be filled.{{sticky header}}{{table alignment}}
