=== Episode 4: Desserts ===
For the signature challenge, the bakers had 2 hours to make 12 [[crème brûlée]]s. The brief specified that the custard must be set and that the bakers were not allowed to use a blowtorch to caramelize the top. For the technical challenge, the bakers had 4 hours to make a [[Spanische Windtorte]]. This dessert had two types of [[meringue]], Swiss and French, designed into a circular box and filled with cream and fruit. Three tiers of sweet cheesecakes were set as the showstopper. The structure must be self-standing, have unique flavors and be completed in {{frac|4|1|2}} hours.
